PETSELFTEST1
# V8 sticker album: the Game rail item opens the play menu, the album is
# its last first-level card (V9: a page of one, the card opens it).
# Dial down = next page, up = back, press = home. Quiet UI only: no pet
# commits of its own. Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# expect min:PET_GAME_MENU 1
# expect min:game=stickers 1
# START and END both print the kind.
# expect min:kind=album 2
# expect none:PET_CARE_RECORD 0
# expect none:PET_CARE_START_FAILED 0
# expect none:PET_GAME_REFUSED 0
# expect none:PET_SLEEP_REQUESTED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# expect max_full_ms 5000
phase day
volume 15
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
# Rail Story(1) -> Game(2), press: play menu (full).
tap down 2500
tap press 6000
# V9: first level = today, brain, move, sound, album: four cheap
# partial highlight moves.
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap down 600
# Album (full), next page, back, press = home (full).
tap press 6000
tap down 2500
tap up 2500
tap press 8000
pet
wait 5000
end
